creatures:
- name: Green Hag
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 82 (rollable(dice=11d8 + 33,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Swim 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Arcana rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Arcana Check), Deception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Deception Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 14  
      **Languages** Common, Elvish, Sylvan  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      

      ***Coven Magic.*** While within 30 feet of at least two hag allies, the hag can cast one of the following spells, requiring no Material components, using the spell's normal casting time, and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 11): [Augury](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618882-augury), [Find Familiar](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618877-find-familiar), [Identify](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619180-identify), [Locate Object](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619002-locate-object), [Scrying](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619007-scrying), or [Unseen Servant](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619209-unseen-servant). The hag must finish a ***Long Rest*** before using this trait to cast that spell again.

      ***Amphibious.*** The hag can breathe air and water.

      ***Mimicry.*** The hag can mimic animal sounds and humanoid voices. A creature that hears the sounds can tell they are imitations only with a successful DC 14 Wisdom (***Insight***) check.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The hag makes two Claw attacks.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Poison damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The hag casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12, rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Spell Attack]) to hit with spell attacks):

      At will: [Dancing Lights](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619058-dancing-lights), [Disguise Self](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619102-disguise-self) (24-hour duration), [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility) (self only, and the hag leaves no tracks while Invisible), [Minor Illusion](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619039-minor-illusion), [Ray of Sickness](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618935-ray-of-sickness) (level 3 version)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

